/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project represents the comprehensive design, implementation, and documentation of a large-scale enterprise network infrastructure. The entire topology was built and simulated using Cisco Packet Tracer \(v8.2.2\),  The design is architected to connect multiple branches and geographical areas \(as depicted in the topology\) while providing centralized services and secure, manageable access.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
